<section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">RUN · WALK · CYCLE</p>
        <h1>Make every mile<br /><span>mean something.</span></h1>
        <p>Find your next event, take your place at the start line, and keep every finish in sight.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="btn" asp-controller="Events" asp-action="Index">Explore events</a>
            <a class="btn btn-secondary" asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Register">Join RaceDay</a>
