<section class="home-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">ONE PLATFORM. EVERY KIND OF RACER.</p>
    <h2>From first entry to finish-line moment.</h2>
    <p>RaceDay brings event discovery, race organisation, and results together in one place.</p>
</section>

<section class="tiles">
    <article class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-number">01</span>
        <h2>Find your next event</h2>
        <p>Browse running, walking, and cycling events and choose the challenge that feels right for you.</p>
        <a asp-controller="Events" asp-action="Index">Browse events</a>
    </article>
    <article class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-number">02</span>
        <h2>Bring your race to life</h2>
        <p>Organisers can publish events and manage categories, participant entries, and results.</p>
        <a asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Login">Organiser sign in</a>
    </article>
    <article class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-number">03</span>
        <h2>Keep every finish in view</h2>
        <p>Follow event leaderboards and keep track of your own race history.</p>
        <a asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Register">Get started</a>
    </article>
</section>